# Extension download acceptance

Do not claim the exporter is tested unless a real click path produced a file on disk.

- API success or progress UI alone is not enough.
- Download must run in the world that actually triggers save (page / content / SW); re-test after architecture changes.
- Without a usable logged-in session, state the blocker; do not fake E2E.
- Success UI must name the file and point to downloads / `chrome://downloads`.

Full checklist: user principle `browser-extension-download-acceptance`.
